Subject: [PATCH 8/8] docs: describe the controller and its single-process
 requirement

Record the controller, the status subresource and the change log in the
changelog, together with the fix for resources that stayed Pending
forever and for Ready=True being reported without a scheduler. Explain
in the README what the control plane now does with a new
InferenceService, why it reports SchedulerUnavailable today, and that
the application must run as a single process (ADR-013). Update the
module mapping with the controller package and its tests.
